                    {
                        "form_id": "6c89728f-f15b-438b-a697-8c8701336855",
                        "entry_id": "7d1f0777-5907-3bba-9b3c-ed10434f6bbb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "кофемо́лках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3731a33-96ed-3cc2-8a30-2d6f78fb6d32",
                        "entry_id": "7d1f0777-5907-3bba-9b3c-ed10434f6bbb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устройство для размола зёрен кофе"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "76fbaccb-682e-41dd-a99e-1424dc617995",
                                "sense_id": "c3731a33-96ed-3cc2-8a30-2d6f78fb6d32",
                                "text": "А мать сидела, зажав между колен ручную кофемолку, и терпеливо вертела ручку."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "abeb031a-3e49-4615-8696-efa7d6b43a89",
                                "sense_id": "c3731a33-96ed-3cc2-8a30-2d6f78fb6d32",
                                "text": "Они собрали жёлуди, высушили их в духовке, размололи в старинной ручной кофемолке и пили горький напиток войны, но ей он казался необыкновенно вкусным."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b131664-f87c-4edb-bf05-45fdbb1694ea",
                                "sense_id": "c3731a33-96ed-3cc2-8a30-2d6f78fb6d32",
                                "text": "Инка выполняет рабочие обязанности механически, как кофемолка, кофеварка или кофемашина."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03628ca8-c30f-486a-b200-d03d679be400",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d1f0777-5907-3bba-9b3c-ed10434f6bbb",
                        "source_sense_id": "c3731a33-96ed-3cc2-8a30-2d6f78fb6d32",
                        "target_lang_word": "coffee grinder",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coffee grinder",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4b4080d-9321-3a55-bb4a-58b24251a5a7",
                                        "entry_id": "b6b162bc-98e9-31ee-b938-76162b40a9da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device for pulverizing or powdering coffee beans so they can be brewed as coffee. (Technically many of the machines tear the coffee beans)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aca930c1-c6dd-3f7a-b881-cee1e17d9a99",
                                        "entry_id": "b6b162bc-98e9-31ee-b938-76162b40a9da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A circular sweep of the leg around the body while supporting oneself on one's hands."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd5dd644-dcfc-4220-a672-a9ae8ec2ade6",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d1f0777-5907-3bba-9b3c-ed10434f6bbb",
                        "source_sense_id": "c3731a33-96ed-3cc2-8a30-2d6f78fb6d32",
                        "target_lang_word": "coffee mill",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coffee mill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3dbe13e-3284-3dc3-b143-07526902a0ca",
                                        "entry_id": "0aab64ab-2874-3368-9ac5-05e5373a761f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mill at which coffee beans are dried, roasted, and ground prior to sale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8ce160c-81a3-410a-9487-39480a5bd1dd",
                                                "sense_id": "f3dbe13e-3284-3dc3-b143-07526902a0ca",
                                                "text": "A good road leads to Pohoiki, once the site of a coffee mill and a prosperous village, but now almost deserted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f79e70a5-67e0-4114-8395-b075a4be2705",
                                                "sense_id": "f3dbe13e-3284-3dc3-b143-07526902a0ca",
                                                "text": "Mary Goretihas run the Jalamba coffee mill near Kituntu for ten years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "229232fd-ec55-4d34-8d49-d7cc852e975e",
                                                "sense_id": "f3dbe13e-3284-3dc3-b143-07526902a0ca",
                                                "text": "During the boom period of the early 1890s, he converted his pineapple cannery into a coffee mill."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45897cda-713a-3ff4-b5fe-d65e936dc5c1",
                                        "entry_id": "0aab64ab-2874-3368-9ac5-05e5373a761f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device designed for grinding coffee beans."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9921b230-3191-40f0-bcdc-012e222bce4a",
                                                "sense_id": "45897cda-713a-3ff4-b5fe-d65e936dc5c1",
                                                "text": "The best way to do the grinding is in an electric coffee mill, if you happen to have one, but the old mortar-and-pestle routine works well, too."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3de82052-0888-4bcb-a89d-528e3c6aca4b",
                                                "sense_id": "45897cda-713a-3ff4-b5fe-d65e936dc5c1",
                                                "text": "After drying, put ingredients, small amounts at a time, into a coffee mill and grind to a spice-like consistency."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ba8c36b-9632-40a4-9f44-2f6812ec8c0e",
                                                "sense_id": "45897cda-713a-3ff4-b5fe-d65e936dc5c1",
                                                "text": "She held an ornate brass coffee mill under her left arm and used her right hand to grind the freshly toasted beans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3c3ba06b-1697-46e4-addf-85402f1da81f",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d1f0777-5907-3bba-9b3c-ed10434f6bbb",
